She came to America with 100 bucks.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.050
She worked her fuckin' face
off every day of her life,

00:10:39.050 --> 00:10:40.360
and didn't have a housekeeper,

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.840
didn't take a vacation,
didn't go anywhere.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.690
She's the most positive,
phenomenal person I know.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:48.620
How the fuck do you think
I'm gonna cry for you?

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:49.593
- Sure, sure.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:53.507
Other people are talking about
your Jab, Jab, Right Hooks,

00:10:53.507 --> 00:10:56.150
but we focus only on the right hooks.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.850
- Yeah, 'cause the right
hooks are more fun.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.400
- Fun? But most of them doesn't work.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:02.840
- Right, 'cause if you
only throw right hooks.

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:06.610
- And I know that some people
are giving a lot of jabs,

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.800
but they cannot right hook.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:08.633
- Correct.

00:11:08.633 --> 00:11:11.770
- They're waiting for too
long, (mutters) for money.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.050
- Too left, too right, you understand?

00:11:14.050 --> 00:11:14.883
- Yes.

00:11:14.883 --> 00:11:18.700
- Too idealistic, too
selfish, you know, I get it.

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:19.757
Why do you think I wrote a book called,

00:11:19.757 --> 00:11:22.627
"Jab, Jab, Jab, Right Hook"?

00:11:22.627 --> 00:11:24.710
- (mutters)
- That's the one.

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:27.520
I can't wait to sell and throw

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:30.630
right hooks for my sneaker on July 16th.

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:34.330
I can't wait to announce my
secret wine project in the Fall.

00:11:34.330 --> 00:11:36.308
I can't wait, I love selling.

00:11:36.308 --> 00:11:37.141
- Me too.

00:11:37.141 --> 00:11:42.010
- I just love giving a lot too,
because you win three ways.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:45.960
First of all, here's a
big part about giving.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:49.340
I don't give away free
content better than anyone

00:11:49.340 --> 00:11:51.540
because I expect people to buy my stuff.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:52.780
- You just give it
because you want to give.

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:53.730
- Correct.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:56.520
Would I like them to
buy my stuff? Of course.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:59.230
Do I care if they do? Ultimately no.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:03.220
Because if I gave with
expectation, I would lose.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.830
- So how would you pull, like,

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.970
a right hook with this
book, for Polish people?

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.270
Why should you buy it, or not?

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.685
Because it's the greatest
book ever written, Poland.

00:12:11.685 --> 00:12:13.070
(host laughs)

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.750
Look, it's not about why they should.

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:16.880
Here's what I think.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:19.930
I have a long track record of success,

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:22.770
I think I've proven
myself to a lot of people

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.980
that I'm in it for the right reasons,

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:28.710
and I don't think it's expensive
to give yourself a chance.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:29.820
I mean you can go read, I don't know,

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:31.870
watch the videos for free,
listen to my podcast for free.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:32.810
I don't need--

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:35.360
Listen, I want to sell because
I appreciate your support.

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:37.100
I don't know what you're on the hook for,

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.770
but for me, you know,

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:41.520
I don't wanna convince
anybody to buy my stuff,

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:42.520
believe in my stuff.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:44.670
I wanna put out the best work I can,

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.340
and then the market decides.

00:12:46.340 --> 00:12:49.170
Warsaw, the suburbs of
Warsaw, and the whole country

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:52.480
decide if this is a quality
book for them, not me.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:56.060
Now look, I think coming in the Fall

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.740
is going to be a big deal.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.030
I don't know how many
of these fuckin' things

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:00.798
you've got sitting around,
but I have a funny feeling--

00:13:00.798 --> 00:13:01.631
- Millions!

00:13:01.631 --> 00:13:03.540
- I have a funny feeling
you're gonna have a lot less

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.500
in October than you had in
September, so I'm excited.

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:08.900
I will say this, I cannot wait to come.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:10.000
I cannot wait to come.

00:13:11.410 --> 00:13:14.180
I'm bringing my dad, who
doesn't go to anything.

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.040
- I don't really mind.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.270
- So it's gonna be great, we'll do that,

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.200
and so it'll be fun.
Lookin' forward to it.

00:13:18.200 --> 00:13:19.549
- Thank you so much.

00:13:19.549 --> 00:13:22.882
(upbeat keyboard music)

